                <note rend="inline" type="source">367N.1115/219: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul at Jerusalem</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Steger</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-05-16T21:00:00-04:00">May 16, 1941—9 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your 86, May 10, noon. Department has replied to telegram no. 455, May 10, 4 p.m.
                    from Minister, Cairo, on subject of evacuation of Americans and has requested
                    Minister to inform you.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
